  "translation": "Gomme Farao Neko a dira ⟨את⟩ Eliyakima, mora wa Yoshiyahu, kgoši boemong bja Yoshiyahu papagwe, gomme a fetola ⟨את⟩ leina la gagwe go Yehoyakima; gomme ⟨את⟩ Yehoahaze a mo tšere, a tsena Mitsrayime, a hwala moo.",
